  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Support Earthquake victims in Taroudant</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">In the wake of the catastrophic earthquake that struck Taroudant, Morocco, on the night of September 8th to 9th, 2023, Tibu Africa is launching a comprehensive initiative to aid the victims of this unprecedented disaster. Our goal is to raise $65,000 to provide vital assistance to the affected families and communities. Let us come together in solidarity and make a profound impact on the lives of those in need.</narrative>
  </description>
